// Map of block ID to block definition. NOTE: singleton-type constraints (e.g. at most one hero or navbar block per page) cannot be expressed in JSON Schema 2020-12 because maxContains/contains are array-only keywords. These rules are enforced in application code instead — see composition.go and composition.ts.
